      quote: "06160 Where\n\n\n1. the DM revises the decision under appeal (for decisions notified before 28.10.13)
        or\n\n\n2. the appeal is accepted by HMCTS, the DM can still consider revising the decision under appeal
        (for\ndecisions notified on or after 28.10.13)\n\n\nthe outcome determines whether the appeal lapses. An
        appeal should be lapsed where the revised\n\ndecision is to the claimant’s advantage1.\n\n\nNote: An appeal
        cannot be lapsed where the decision is superseded.\n\n\n                                               \
        \                                           1 SS Act 98, s 9(6)"
